      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">No matter how dark the passage before you lies, you are not deterred. Whenever you are in dim light or darkness, your senses heighten, allowing you to benefit from the Search exploration activity and to make a Seek check at the start of your turns. You treat adjacent undetected creatures of your level or lower as Hidden from you.</span></p>"
